<title>JAPAN: Miura to buy back shares for stock option scheme.</title>
<headline>Miura to buy back shares for stock option scheme.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miura Co Ltd said on Monday that it would buy back 840,000 of its shares, or 1.5 billion yen worth, in order to introduce a stock option scheme.</p>
<p>Miura makes industrial boilers.</p>
</text>
